# 📖 About

This repository was created to document my learning journey and continuous development in **COBOL programming for IBM Mainframe environments**.

The goal is to share practical exercises, code examples, and projects covering everything from COBOL fundamentals to enterprise technologies widely used in banking, insurance, and mission-critical systems.

Throughout this project, new content will be added covering the IBM Mainframe ecosystem, including **JCL, DB2, VSAM, CICS, file handling, batch processing, and Balance Line techniques**.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Learn COBOL through hands-on practice
- Develop programming logic for Mainframe environments
- Build applications following industry best practices
- Share knowledge with the community
- Build a professional Mainframe portfolio

---

## 🛠️ Technologies

- COBOL
- IBM z/OS
- TSO/ISPF
- JCL
- DB2
- VSAM
- CICS

