# 📚 Topics Covered

## COBOL Fundamentals

- COBOL Program Structure
- IDENTIFICATION DIVISION
- ENVIRONMENT DIVISION
- DATA DIVISION
- PROCEDURE DIVISION
- Programming Best Practices

## Variables and Data Types

- PIC
- VALUE
- MOVE
- REDEFINES
- OCCURS
- Data Level Numbers (01, 05, 10, 77, 88)

## Arithmetic Operations and Business Calculations

- ADD
- SUBTRACT
- MULTIPLY
- DIVIDE
- COMPUTE
- Financial Calculations
- Percentage Calculations
- Running Totals
- Totals and Subtotals
- Rounding Operations

## Decision Structures

- IF / ELSE
- EVALUATE

## Loop Structures

- PERFORM
- PERFORM UNTIL
